# Tests for the shapes module of the stage0 sample `modules`.

shapesTest is test
shapesTest purpose "A 3 by 4 rectangle has area 12 and is an oblong; a 2 by 2 one is a square; a rectangle has 4 sides"
shapesTest verifies area multipliesSides
shapesTest verifies kindOf comparesSides
shapesTest verifies sideCount countsSides
shapesTest typeParameter none
shapesTest input none
shapesTest output none
shapesTest outputOwnedBy none
shapesTest raises none
shapesTest effect none
shapesTest uses none
shapesTest memoryHeap false
shapesTest async false
shapesTest maxRecursion none
shapesTest label begin loopKind none
shapesTest label begin within none
shapesTest label checkSquare loopKind none
shapesTest label checkSquare within none
shapesTest label checkSides loopKind none
shapesTest label checkSides within none
shapesTest label wrong loopKind none
shapesTest label wrong within none
shapesTest let yes Bool true immutable
shapesTest let three Int64 3 immutable
shapesTest let four Int64 4 immutable
shapesTest let twelve Int64 12 immutable
shapesTest let two Int64 2 immutable
shapesTest let wrongText String "a rectangle was given the wrong kind" immutable
shapesTest at begin do makeOblong
shapesTest at begin do readArea
shapesTest at begin do expectArea
shapesTest at begin do readOblongKind
shapesTest at begin match oblongKind Kind
shapesTest at begin case Kind.square bind none none goto wrong
shapesTest at begin case Kind.oblong bind none none goto checkSquare
shapesTest at checkSquare do makeSquare
shapesTest at checkSquare do readSquareKind
shapesTest at checkSquare match squareKind Kind
shapesTest at checkSquare case Kind.square bind none none goto checkSides
shapesTest at checkSquare case Kind.oblong bind none none goto wrong
shapesTest at checkSides do readSides
shapesTest at checkSides do expectSides
shapesTest at checkSides return ok none
shapesTest at wrong do failKind
shapesTest at wrong return ok none

makeOblong is call
makeOblong in shapesTest
makeOblong invokes Rectangle.new
makeOblong argument width Int64 three copy
makeOblong argument height Int64 four copy
makeOblong result oblong Rectangle
makeOblong ownedBy none
makeOblong cleanedBy none
makeOblong borrows none
makeOblong catch none
makeOblong suppresses none

readArea is call
readArea in shapesTest
readArea invokes area
readArea argument shape Rectangle oblong copy
readArea result oblongArea Int64
readArea ownedBy none
readArea cleanedBy none
readArea borrows none
readArea catch none
readArea suppresses none

expectArea is call
expectArea in shapesTest
expectArea invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectArea argument expected Int64 twelve copy
expectArea argument actual Int64 oblongArea copy
expectArea result none
expectArea ownedBy none
expectArea cleanedBy none
expectArea borrows none
expectArea catch none
expectArea suppresses none

readOblongKind is call
readOblongKind in shapesTest
readOblongKind invokes kindOf
readOblongKind argument shape Rectangle oblong copy
readOblongKind result oblongKind Kind
readOblongKind ownedBy none
readOblongKind cleanedBy none
readOblongKind borrows none
readOblongKind catch none
readOblongKind suppresses none

makeSquare is call
makeSquare in shapesTest
makeSquare invokes Rectangle.new
makeSquare argument width Int64 two copy
makeSquare argument height Int64 two copy
makeSquare result square Rectangle
makeSquare ownedBy none
makeSquare cleanedBy none
makeSquare borrows none
makeSquare catch none
makeSquare suppresses none

readSquareKind is call
readSquareKind in shapesTest
readSquareKind invokes kindOf
readSquareKind argument shape Rectangle square copy
readSquareKind result squareKind Kind
readSquareKind ownedBy none
readSquareKind cleanedBy none
readSquareKind borrows none
readSquareKind catch none
readSquareKind suppresses none

readSides is call
readSides in shapesTest
readSides invokes sideCount
readSides argument none
readSides result sideTotal Int64
readSides ownedBy none
readSides cleanedBy none
readSides borrows none
readSides catch none
readSides suppresses none

expectSides is call
expectSides in shapesTest
expectSides invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectSides argument expected Int64 four copy
expectSides argument actual Int64 sideTotal copy
expectSides result none
expectSides ownedBy none
expectSides cleanedBy none
expectSides borrows none
expectSides catch none
expectSides suppresses none

failKind is call
failKind in shapesTest
failKind invokes test.fail
failKind argument message String wrongText lend
failKind result none
failKind ownedBy none
failKind cleanedBy none
failKind borrows none
failKind catch none
failKind suppresses none
